{
  "meta": {
    "version": "1.0",
    "axes": [
      "power",
      "control",
      "spin",
      "comfort"
    ],
    "mass_axis": "sw",
    "formula": {
      "power": "0.65*Compass_X + 0.35*(CPI/10) + (maxBeam-23)*2.2 + (head-100)*0.8",
      "control": "(100-power) + pattern_density_bonus + (100-head)*0.7",
      "spin": "Compass_Y + pattern_openness_bonus",
      "comfort": "90 - (RA-57)*6 + (strungWeight-300)*0.12",
      "difficulty": "((100-head)*2 + max(0,SW-300)*0.55 + densePatternBonus + max(0,60-RA)*0.8)*1.15"
    },
    "notes": [
      "CPI 與 Compass_X 相關係數 0.918，殘差=重量效應（已由 SW 承接），故合併為單一力量軸而非各自獨立",
      "PRESTIGE：硬 Gate 需 NTRP>=4.0 + 無傷病 + 力量自足 + 手感偏清脆；另加 score_multiplier 0.85",
      "cosmetic=true 的型號為塗裝款，vector 繼承本尊，引擎排名時應去重、僅在文案層推薦",
      "羅盤座標為使用者目測 ±5；若原廠提供向量檔應優先覆蓋"
    ]
  },
